                "text": "Proud to introduce a resolution designating October 10-17 as National Perinatal Nurses Week to recognize their hard work and dedication to caring for expecting mothers.\n\nAs a husband of a nurse, I will always advocate for these critical healthcare workers in Congress. https://t.co/pPh0UDPDBC",
