                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Infants that survive abortion and are viable outside the womb should receive the life-saving healthcare they deserve.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nI cosponsored the Born-Alive Abortion Survivors Protection Act to make sure these innocent lives are protected, and I am glad to see it pass the House today.",
