                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Red tape imposed by the federal government is preventing hardworking Americans from accessing healthcare. I introduced the Improving Care and Access to Nurses (I CAN) Act to remove barriers for Advanced Practice Registered Nurses (APRNs) to practice the full scope of their education and training, allowing patients to receive the care they need.",
