                "text": "Yesterday, I met with leaders at University Hospitals to discuss access to rural healthcare, the nursing shortage, and how to improve patient care in Northeast Ohio. I look forward to continuing to work with them to deliver quality healthcare to Ohioans. https://t.co/qtlzPoHcfC",
